@startuml 001-app-skeleton-sequence
title 001 app-skeleton：時序圖（加入組別與階段同步）

actor "第1組學生" as S1
actor "第2組學生" as S2
actor "老師" as T
participant "app.py" as App
participant "Activity" as Act
participant "views" as V

S1 -> App : POST /api/student/join {team: 第1組}
App -> Act : join(第1組)
Act --> App : token1
App --> S1 : {team, token}（存 sessionStorage）
S2 -> App : POST /api/student/join {team: 第1組}
App -> Act : join(第1組)
Act --> App : TeamTakenError
App --> S2 : 409 此組已有裝置加入

S1 -> App : WS /ws?role=student&token=token1
App -> Act : team_of(token1) = 第1組
App -> V : student_view(第1組)
App --> S1 : {type: state, seq: 1, view: preparing}
T -> App : WS /ws?role=teacher&key=…
App --> T : {seq: 1, view: teacher_view}

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/start（X-Teacher-Key）
App -> Act : start()（鎖內：檢查 → 讓出點 → 寫入 → version+1）
Act -> Act : changed.notify_all()
par 每條連線各自的送出迴圈
  App -> V : student_view(第1組)
  App --> S1 : {seq: 2, view: answering}
else
  App -> V : teacher_view
  App --> T : {seq: 2, view: answering}
end
note over App
  view 與該連線上次送出的相同 則 不送；
  他組動作不會造成本連線的推播
end note
@enduml
